**Program Chair**: Donnie Melvin • [dmelvin@vhcc.edu](mailto:dmelvin@vhcc.edu) • 276-739-2453

This program is designed to prepare a student for employment in the Electrical, Electronic, or Industrial maintenance field. In addition, this program aids students that are eligible to sit for their Virginia Electrical journeyman license.

