## Career Studies Certificate (CSC) in Practical Electrical Technician

Two semesters; one year

This program is designed to prepare the student for full-time employment as an electrician’s helper, immediately upon completion of the program. A student who completes the program is capable of performing the job skills normally expected of beginning electricians, working with a licensed electrician.

